WEBVTT

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:15.750
Full energy is troubled because there's no place to go

00:00:16.210 --> 00:00:22.030
A slight shake destroys boredom

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:28.170
I Ride, On the White Line  OH, OH, OH

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:34.240
Sit Down  At the place I trust  OH, OH, OH

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:37.540
We can go even if we're lost

00:00:37.770 --> 00:00:43.650
Everyone receives freedom and passion

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:49.850
We were born to shine, and our journey continues

00:00:50.180 --> 00:00:56.060
Your soul is the key that supports our uncertain days

00:00:56.350 --> 00:01:02.000
The best growth creates an unstoppable WILD DRIVE

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:08.270
We still quietly knock on the door

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:23.290
Resorting to dirty tricks, Noa kidnaps Mokuba.

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:26.220
But I promise to get Mokuba back.

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:31.620
Daimon, if you're going to get in my way, I'll mow you down.

00:01:31.620 --> 00:01:38.010
Even if your Deck Master is Jinzo, I'll win this duel!

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:44.020
Attack From Space
Satellite Cannon

00:01:50.460 --> 00:01:52.390
What was that?

00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:54.800
It looked like a rocket.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.860
Can it be...

00:01:56.980 --> 00:02:01.760
How can I prove that I'm Honda?

00:02:01.940 --> 00:02:04.450
Brother, let's hurry.

00:02:04.740 --> 00:02:06.800
We have to find Honda.

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.800
Shizuka.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:14.200
But Shizuka will keep holding me if I stay this way.

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.240
Shizuka's breasts are like marshmallows.

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.400
They're so soft!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.500
I thought I heard Honda's voice.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.100
Yeah.

00:02:28.100 --> 00:02:29.490
Were we imagining things?

00:02:29.900 --> 00:02:35.780
If I can be this happy, Hiroto Honda will be a monkey for the rest of my life.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:37.440
No way!

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:38.780
This robot is...

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.380
What?

00:02:40.380 --> 00:02:41.500
You punk!

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:46.340
You're Honda, and you're pretending to be a monkey!

00:02:47.510 --> 00:02:50.860
Don't pretend to be a monkey when you're in trouble!

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:54.750
Hey!  What's with this?

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:59.520
We're not convinced that you're the “real” Honda.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:02.760
I am!  I was like this when I woke up!

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.260
I feel bad for him.

00:03:05.480 --> 00:03:07.080
Shizuka!

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.760
Stop groveling!

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:20.800
3600 vs 1200.  I have a big lead.

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:21.580
Be quiet.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.340
My turn.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:26.500
I activate Injection Fairy Lily's effect!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:31.900
By paying 2000 life points, Lily gains 3000 attack points!

00:03:35.100 --> 00:03:37.590
Go!  Injection Fairy Lily!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.600
It's time for a checkup!

00:03:39.600 --> 00:03:40.700
Injection!

00:03:45.060 --> 00:03:48.210
I activate Twin-Headed Behemoth's effect!

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:57.240
So it can resurrect.  How resilient.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.020
I set a card.

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:04.260
From my hand, I activate the Quick-Play Spell, Emergency Provisions!

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:14.100
By tributing one set card, Emergency Provisions gives me 1000 life points.

00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:15.270
I end my turn.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.080
He regained life points again.

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:22.600
I can't win unless I stop his life restoration combo.

00:04:22.600 --> 00:04:24.060
Besides...

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:27.260
The card that fired the rocket...

00:04:27.260 --> 00:04:31.250
When he ended his turn, the needle went up.

00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:33.490
What's that meter for?

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:38.990
Kaiba!

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:40.990
Yugi!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:46.000
Your friends have finally arrived.

00:04:46.260 --> 00:04:49.730
Seto, they'll witness your demise.

00:04:50.270 --> 00:04:53.700
My brother won't lose!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.470
He will rescue me!

00:04:55.820 --> 00:04:59.650
You seem to trust him fully.

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:01.210
But does he trust you?

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:06.060
Yugi!  Look!

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.520
Kaiba's opponent's Deck Master is...

00:05:10.460 --> 00:05:11.820
Jinzo!

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.240
Does that mean...

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:19.680
Kaiba's traps are disabled.

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:20.760
Oh no!

00:05:20.760 --> 00:05:23.560
He's at a huge disadvantage!

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:28.240
I've been at a disadvantage from the start of this duel.

00:05:28.240 --> 00:05:32.580
But if there's no path, I just need to create my own!

00:05:32.580 --> 00:05:33.860
My turn!

00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:41.470
Daimon!  I'll use this card to destroy your life restoration combo!

00:05:41.470 --> 00:05:43.460
The spell card, Heavy Storm!

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:51.140
Heavy Storm destroys all spell and trap cards.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:54.830
All traps on your field will be removed!

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:01.760
Seto Kaiba, you'll now face an even harsher reality.

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:03.370
I activate my Counter Trap!

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.520
Imperial Order!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:08.850
What?

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:21.700
By paying 700 life points each turn, Imperial Order negates all spell cards on the field.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:26.420
Now you can't use trap or spell cards.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:28.800
Kaiba.

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:29.870
Not good.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:31.630
He's in a worse situation.

00:06:32.070 --> 00:06:33.500
Big brother...

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.970
Daimon completely knows how Seto duels.

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:40.980
My turn.  I draw a card.

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:47.850
My life restoration combo activates!

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.780
And I keep Imperial Order!

00:06:51.990 --> 00:06:58.490
It's time you feel the power of Gozaburo's ultimate weapon.

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.000
What?

00:07:00.220 --> 00:07:03.000
Satellite Cannon, prepare to fire!

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.670
Fire!

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:51.410
Where did the attack come from?

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:52.150
It can't be!

00:07:52.360 --> 00:08:00.560
Yes.  Satellite Cannon is 36,000km above in geosynchronous orbit.

00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.710
No way!

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.260
He has a monster that can attack from space?

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:14.270
Due to Satellite Cannon's effect, Level 7-or-below monsters can't attack it.

00:08:15.360 --> 00:08:16.270
What?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:25.360
Attacks from your weak monsters can't reach Satellite Cannon.

00:08:26.660 --> 00:08:34.290
And Satellite Cannon gains 1000 attack points every time I end my turn.

00:08:34.660 --> 00:08:39.830
How does it feel to be tormented by Gozaburo's weapon?

00:08:39.830 --> 00:08:45.300
I watched you drive Gozaburo to death.

00:08:45.300 --> 00:08:47.850
And I'll now make a declaration!

00:08:48.300 --> 00:08:53.310
You used Mokuba to achieve that feat!

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:55.040
Kaiba did what?

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.480
No way!  My brother used me?

00:08:58.480 --> 00:08:59.740
You didn't know?

00:09:00.370 --> 00:09:04.050
Then listen closely to this story.

00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:06.480
About the real Seto.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:15.000
Do you remember Gozaburo's final test?

00:09:16.600 --> 00:09:22.270
You needed to gain great wealth thru business.

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:29.840
You were far better at making money than Gozaburo expected.

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:35.400
Once you made a fortune, you began a terrifying plan.

00:09:36.890 --> 00:09:42.390
Seto, why did you call us here?

00:09:42.760 --> 00:09:52.400
The five of you are talented in your fields, but President Gozaburo treats you unfairly.

00:09:53.160 --> 00:09:58.040
Would you like to run Kaiba Corporation with me?

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:06.410
We decided to work together and started buying Kaiba Corporation stock.

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:09.920
But it was difficult to corner the market.

00:10:10.360 --> 00:10:14.420
Someone on our side was leaking information to Gozaburo.

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.260
And you said it was Mokuba!

00:10:21.560 --> 00:10:23.440
I remember that time...

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:42.850
Big brother...

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:45.860
How dare you sabotage me!

00:10:46.260 --> 00:10:48.000
Big brother!  Believe me!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:49.400
It's not me!

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.660
Silence!

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.060
Throw him out!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:59.070
It was the hardest time in my life.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:07.580
Full of sadness and nowhere to go, Mokuba was taken in by Gozaburo.

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:13.230
Gozaburo's intention was to get Mokuba's two cards.

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:18.200
With Mokuba by his side, Gozaburo controlled 51 cards.

00:11:18.200 --> 00:11:21.630
So he stopped buying more stock.

00:11:27.880 --> 00:11:29.780
It's been a year.

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:33.460
To commemorate this day, I'm calling an emergency board meeting.

00:11:33.460 --> 00:11:35.280
It's pointless, Seto.

00:11:35.500 --> 00:11:38.540
I know you're trying to overthrow me.

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:41.740
But you only have 49% of the stock.

00:11:41.740 --> 00:11:44.630
I have 51%.

00:11:44.630 --> 00:11:47.840
So I'm still the president.

00:11:48.850 --> 00:11:53.080
As of today, Kaiba Corporation declares bankruptcy!

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:56.250
All business is transferred to our affiliated companies!

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:59.710
So your stock is nothing but worthless pieces of paper!

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:06.030
You must work for me for the rest of your life to repay your loan!

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:08.100
Wait!

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.170
Mokuba.

00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:14.680
I give my two cards to my brother!

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:18.460
Impossible!  He abandoned you!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:21.920
He was just upset that day.

00:12:22.280 --> 00:12:23.440
Mokuba!

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.450
I'm on my brother's side!

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.910
The tables have turned.

00:12:27.910 --> 00:12:30.170
You're the one who loses everything.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:38.920
Losing his will to live, Gozaburo died soon after.

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.950
What's your point, Daimon?

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:43.660
You planned everything.

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:46.360
The one who leaked information to Gozaburo was...

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:49.460
You, Seto Kaiba!

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:53.520
No way!

00:12:57.100 --> 00:13:01.950
You wanted to stage a takeover, but Gozaburo had unlimited funds.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.530
You couldn't win if you played fair and square.

00:13:05.530 --> 00:13:11.270
So you decided to use Mokuba so that Gozaburo would lower his guard.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:17.880
You turned Mokuba into a traitor and sent him to Gozaburo.

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.600
You knew from the start...

00:13:21.600 --> 00:13:26.770
...that no matter what you did to him, he would come back to you.

00:13:28.310 --> 00:13:31.820
I trusted Mokuba.

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:34.960
I believed our bond would defeat Gozaburo!

00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:37.080
You're making excuses, Seto.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:43.130
No matter how hurt he was, you kept using him.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:46.890
And drove Gozaburo to death!

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.210
It's a lie.  He didn't use me...

00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:56.820
Afterwards, you didn't care about The Big Five's ideas.

00:13:56.820 --> 00:13:59.450
You ran the company on your own.

00:13:59.800 --> 00:14:03.700
You used us five too!

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:08.500
I'll get my revenge by taking your body!

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:10.420
Life is a game.

00:14:10.420 --> 00:14:14.000
I won't let you ruin my dream!

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:15.510
My turn!

00:14:16.570 --> 00:14:19.150
I summon Spirit Ryu!

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:25.780
I switch Twin-Headed Behemoth to attack position!

00:14:25.780 --> 00:14:29.460
Spirit Ryu attacks Injection Fairy Lily!

00:14:29.460 --> 00:14:31.210
Spirit Sonic!

00:14:36.260 --> 00:14:37.930
Have you lost your mind, Seto?

00:14:38.180 --> 00:14:40.680
I activate Lily's effect!

00:14:44.880 --> 00:14:46.000
Kaiba!

00:14:46.000 --> 00:14:47.130
This is bad!

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:50.260
Kaiba will lose all his life points!

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:52.030
I win!

00:14:52.360 --> 00:14:53.880
Not yet.

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:56.960
I activate Spirit Ryu's effect!

00:14:56.960 --> 00:15:03.780
For every Dragon that I discard from my hand, Spirit Ryu gains 1000 attack points!

00:15:28.050 --> 00:15:33.140
He protected his life points by raising his monster's attack points!

00:15:33.520 --> 00:15:36.040
Kaiba's moves are crazy!

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:38.000
Is he getting desperate?

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:41.380
No!  This is Kaiba's strategy!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:42.940
Kaiba's strategy?

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:47.450
Twin-Headed Behemoth, attack Lily!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:52.760
I don't have enough life points to activate Lily's effect!

00:16:07.970 --> 00:16:12.510
His deck uses a life restoration combo to strengthen his monsters.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.170
But if that cycle is broken...

00:16:15.170 --> 00:16:16.530
My turn!

00:16:22.820 --> 00:16:28.740
Daimon, don't forget to pay 700 life points to keep Imperial Order.

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:33.550
I destroy Imperial Order this turn!

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:37.270
Now he can use his spell cards!

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:38.400
I see!

00:16:38.400 --> 00:16:42.020
Once the cycle is broken, he can't regain life points.

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:44.780
His combo falls apart!

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:47.280
Now Kaiba has a chance!

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:54.130
Daimon, if you can't even handle this, then you don't have the smarts to run a company.

00:16:54.130 --> 00:16:57.660
Be quiet!  My turn isn't over!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:59.590
I set a monster in defense position!

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:02.330
Satellite Cannon, fire!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:15.500
My turn!

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:21.320
I activate Pot of Greed from my hand.

00:17:21.320 --> 00:17:24.680
I draw two cards from my deck.

00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:28.800
Next, I summon Possessed Dark Soul!

00:17:33.000 --> 00:17:36.560
Dark Soul!  Attack his defending monster!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:39.340
Soul Burning!

00:17:41.820 --> 00:17:43.000
It won't work!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:44.850
Dreamsprite!

00:17:45.510 --> 00:17:51.910
When Dreamsprite is attacked, she can switch the attack to a different monster.

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:56.570
Dark Soul attacks Satellite Cannon instead!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:06.160
No good.  Kaiba's attack can't reach outer space.

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:07.680
My turn.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:13.640
In one turn, Satellite Cannon's attack points will rise to 2000.

00:18:13.640 --> 00:18:16.170
Which I'll use to drop Seto to 0 life points.

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:20.520
I end my turn.

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:26.310
He won't attack!

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:29.640
He's gathering energy for one final blow!

00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:34.860
Level 7-or-below monsters can't attack Satellite Cannon.

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:38.600
Seto, your life will end next turn.

00:18:38.840 --> 00:18:42.660
He won't get a monster above Level 7.

00:18:43.020 --> 00:18:48.280
Actually, Kaiba still has a certain monster in his deck!

00:18:48.280 --> 00:18:51.020
Everything depends on this draw.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:55.640
My turn.

00:18:55.640 --> 00:19:00.250
Awaken!  The blue flame that resides in my deck!

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:04.530
It can't be!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:05.690
Here I go!

00:19:06.220 --> 00:19:08.690
I summon a monster in defense position!

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:13.460
I activate my Deck Master's ability!

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:20.970
Lord of D.'s Deck Master ability lets me Special Summon a Dragon by paying 500 life points!

00:19:21.370 --> 00:19:24.450
I tribute two monsters!

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:30.210
Two tributes?

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:36.130
Show yourself, Blue-Eyes White Dragon!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:45.360
Fly into outer space, Blue-Eyes!

00:19:48.130 --> 00:19:51.360
Blue-Eyes is a Level 8 monster.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:54.870
I can't believe he was able to draw it now!

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:58.100
Blue-Eyes, break through the unknown wall!

00:19:59.350 --> 00:20:05.510
Satellite Cannon only has attack points when it's attacking.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:09.280
So its attack points are...

00:20:10.440 --> 00:20:11.300
Zero!

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:12.430
Oh no!

00:20:12.430 --> 00:20:17.170
The dream I have for games won't lose against a killing machine!

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:23.590
Vanish, Gozaburo's ghost!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:27.370
Burst Stream of Destruction!

00:20:49.080 --> 00:20:50.480
He did it!

00:20:50.700 --> 00:20:52.330
Kaiba pulled out a win!

00:20:58.580 --> 00:20:59.830
Where's Mokuba?

00:21:01.020 --> 00:21:03.240
Who knows, Seto.

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:06.500
But don't think it's over!

00:21:09.220 --> 00:21:11.710
All right!  My brother won!

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:15.560
Mokuba?  You don't hate Seto?

00:21:15.560 --> 00:21:17.640
Even after he betrayed you?

00:21:17.640 --> 00:21:22.720
As long as I can help my brother, I don't care what hardships I face!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:30.900
Mokuba...

00:21:32.110 --> 00:21:34.470
Mokuba!

00:21:44.260 --> 00:21:48.910
Kaiba won, so every member of The Big Five has been defeated.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:52.280
But Mokuba hasn't returned.  And Honda is still a monkey.

00:21:52.280 --> 00:21:55.130
This isn't what we agreed to!

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:58.680
Kaiba leaves on his own to save Mokuba.

00:21:58.680 --> 00:22:03.200
Yugi and I go after him, but we become lost in Kaiba's mansion.

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:05.460
That's when we see...

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:08.800
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Mystery Deepens  Noa's Identity

00:22:08.800 --> 00:22:10.280
Duel, standby!

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:21.390
The sun never sets
It rises forever

00:22:21.390 --> 00:22:30.340
Don't let a dream end as a dream

00:22:30.670 --> 00:22:35.310
The straight rail and harsh route

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:39.280
Whether to go or not 
all of yourself

00:22:39.710 --> 00:22:47.250
I'm tired of counting on my fingers inside this cage

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:50.820
Respect! Boys  Show me how you act tough

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:55.590
Draw a map, even if it's sloppy

00:22:55.590 --> 00:23:05.700
And walk it without stopping

00:23:05.700 --> 00:23:13.310
The sun never sets
If I can be like you

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:22.280
Create freedom by exceeding common ideas

00:23:22.280 --> 00:23:30.260
I want to trust myself
